freealut
------------------------------------------
Freealut is a free implementation of OpenAL's ALUT standard.

Runtime requirements:
  bash-5.2.21-1
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libalut-devel-1.1.0+git20240802-1bl2
  libalut0-1.1.0+git20240802-1bl2
  libopenal-devel-1.25.2-1
  libopenal1-1.25.2-1
  pkg-config-3.0.11-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20261107-1
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.13-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libopenal-devel-1.25.2-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/vancegroup/freealut

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/vancegroup/freealut.git

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack freealut-1.1.0+git20240802-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./freealut-1.1.0+git20240802-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/freealut-1.1.0+git20240802-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/freealut-1.1.0+git20240802-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libalut0-1.1.0+git20240802-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libalut-devel-1.1.0+git20240802-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(freealut)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/freealut.README
  /usr/share/doc/freealut/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/freealut/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/freealut/ChangeLog
  /usr/share/doc/freealut/NEWS
  /usr/share/doc/freealut/README.md

(libalut0)
  /usr/bin/cygalut-0.dll

(libalut-devel)
  /usr/bin/freealut-config
  /usr/include/AL/alut.h
  /usr/lib/libalut.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/freealut.pc

